OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSoweto presents more exciting new
OL,7,     Freleases and jazz classics, and
OL,8,     Fauthor and jazz appreciator Geoff
OL,9,     FDyer has a third best-loved jazz
OL,10,     Frecord to share tonight, for 4/4.
OL,11,G0030 Through the Night
OL,12,     FAvi Avital plays the mandolin with
OL,13,     FKsenija Sidorova on the accordion
OL,14,     Ffor this concert made up of pieces
OL,15,     Fby Kreisler, Mozart, Stravinsky,
OL,16,     FBartok, Prokofiev, Falla, and
OL,17,     FVilla-Lobos.
